msgid "Processing and plotting for rovibrational line lists (DAT2GR)"
msgstr "振转谱线列表的处理与绘图（DAT2GR）"

msgid ""
"The DAT2GR program is used to process and to generate plots from "
"rovibrational infrared and Raman line lists generated by the RCI and RVCI "
"programs that are part of the VSCF and VCI progam."
msgstr ""
"DAT2GR 程序用于处理和生成振转红外与拉曼谱线列表的图形，这些谱线列表由 VSCF 与 VCI 程序中的 RCI 和 RVCI 程序生成。"

msgid "The DAT2GR program (DAT2GR)"
msgstr "DAT2GR 程序（DAT2GR）"

msgid "``DAT2GR,options``"
msgstr "``DAT2GR,options``"

msgid ""
"The ``DAT2GR`` program allows for the processing of rovibrational line lists"
" (IR and Raman) to modify data, apply line-broadening and temperature "
"effects or generate plots. The file containing the line list must be "
"generated before by the RCI or RVCI methods which are part of the ``VSCF`` "
"or ``VCI`` programs. ``DAT2GR`` does not require any ``XSURF`` or ``VSCF`` "
"calculations prior to its call, but requests at least a Hartree-Fock "
"calculation, which is always needed in Molpro. The following *options* are "
"available:"
msgstr ""
"``DAT2GR`` 程序允许处理振转谱线列表（红外与拉曼），以修改数据、施加线宽与温度效应或生成图形。包含谱线列表的文件必须事先由 ``VSCF`` "
"或 ``VCI`` 程序中的 RCI 或 RVCI 方法生成。\\ ``DAT2GR`` 在调用前不需要任何 ``XSURF`` 或 ``VSCF`` "
"计算，但至少需要一次 Hartree-Fock 计算，这在 Molpro 中总是必需的。以下 *options* 可用："

msgid ""
"**``EXTERN``\\ =\\ *filename*** This keyword is mandatory and requests the "
"filename of the file containing the input file (rovibrational line list) as "
"generated from the VSCF or VCI programs."
msgstr ""
"**``EXTERN``\\ =\\ *\\ filename*** 该关键字为必填项，用于指定包含输入文件（振转谱线列表）的文件名，该文件由 VSCF"
" 或 VCI 程序生成。"

msgid ""
"**``DUMP``\\ =\\ *filename*** This key defines the output file to be "
"generated."
msgstr "**``DUMP``\\ =\\ *\\ filename*** 该关键字定义要生成的输出文件。"

msgid ""
"**``TYPE``\\ =\\ *string*** (=’IR’ Default) This option controls the type of"
" line list to be handled, but it will be set according to the input line "
"list type anyway. Options are ’IR’ or ’Raman’."
msgstr ""
"**``TYPE``\\ =\\ *\\ string*** （默认 "
"’IR’）该选项控制要处理的谱线列表类型，但无论如何都会根据输入谱线列表的类型进行设置。选项为 ’IR’ 或 ’Raman’。"

msgid ""
"**``METHOD``\\ =\\ *string*** (=’INT’ Default) This option controls the "
"method of data handling, e.g. whether the data should be modified/filtered "
"or (re-)calculated. Options are ’MOD’ (modify/filter exisiting line list), "
"’INT’ (calculate T-dependent intensities from exisiting intensities at "
":math:`T=0` K), ’INT_TM’ (calculate Raman intensities from transition "
"moments :math:`R_0` and :math:`R_2` in the input line list)."
msgstr ""
"**``METHOD``\\ =\\ *\\ string*** （默认 "
"’INT’）该选项控制数据处理的方法，例如数据应被修改/筛选还是（重新）计算。选项为 ’MOD’（修改/筛选已有谱线列表）、’INT’（由 "
":math:`T=0` K 时的已有强度计算随温度变化的强度）、’INT_TM’（由输入谱线列表中的跃迁矩 :math:`R_0` 和 "
":math:`R_2` 计算拉曼强度）。"

msgid ""
"**``PROFILE``\\ =\\ *string*** (=’GAUSSIAN’ Default) This option controls "
"the line shape to be used for accounting of line-broadening or in the case "
"of data modification/filtering (``METHOD=’MOD’``) what's to be done. "
"``PROFILE=’Lines’`` will return a line list again without any broadening. "
"``PROFILE=’Lorentz’`` sets the line shape to be Lorentzians, "
"``PROFILE=’Gauss’`` will use Gaussians. ``PROFILE=’Voigt’`` specifies a line"
" shape from numerical convolution of Gaussians and Lorentzians, which is "
"numerically expensive. The combined half-widths :math:`\\sigma` for the "
"Gaussian and :math:`\\gamma` for the Lorentzian line shape are calculated "
"from the temperature and pressure using a physical description. "
"``PROFILE=’Gaussian’`` specifies a simple Gaussian line shape with half-"
"width ``SIGMA``. For ``METHOD=’MOD’`` the options are ``PROFILE=’SORT’`` to "
"sort the data by the column specified with the keyword ``SORT`` or "
"``PROFILE=’SYMSEL’`` to apply symmetry selection rules."
msgstr ""
"**``PROFILE``\\ =\\ *\\ string*** （默认 ’GAUSSIAN’）该选项控制用于考虑线宽的线型，或在数据修改/筛选（\\"
" ``METHOD=’MOD’``\\ ）情况下指定要执行的操作。\\ ``PROFILE=’Lines’`` 将再次返回不带任何展宽的谱线列表。\\ "
"``PROFILE=’Lorentz’`` 将线型设为洛伦兹线型，\\ ``PROFILE=’Gauss’`` 将使用高斯线型。\\ "
"``PROFILE=’Voigt’`` 指定由高斯与洛伦兹线型数值卷积得到的线型，其数值计算代价较高。高斯线型的组合半宽 :math:`\\sigma`"
" 与洛伦兹线型的半宽 :math:`\\gamma` 由温度和压力通过物理描述计算得到。\\ ``PROFILE=’Gaussian’`` 指定具有半宽"
" ``SIGMA`` 的简单高斯线型。对于 ``METHOD=’MOD’``\\ ，选项为 ``PROFILE=’SORT’`` 以按关键字 "
"``SORT`` 指定的列对数据排序，或 ``PROFILE=’SYMSEL’`` 以应用对称性选择定则。"

msgid ""
"**``SORT``\\ =\\ *n*** (=12 (frequencies) Default) ``PRINT=2`` enables "
"additional printout."
msgstr "**``SORT``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** （默认 12（频率））\\ ``PRINT=2`` 启用额外输出。"

msgid ""
"**``EINC``\\ =\\ *value*** (= 0.1 Default, in cm\\ :math:`^{-1}`) "
"Incremental energy (resolution) to be considered."
msgstr "**``EINC``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** （默认 0.1，单位 cm\\ :math:`^{-1}`\\ ）要考虑的能量增量（分辨率）。"

msgid ""
"**``EMAX``\\ =\\ *value*** (= 5000 Default, in cm\\ :math:`^{-1}`) This "
"option specifies the maximum energy of the spectral range to be considered."
msgstr ""
"**``EMAX``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** （默认 5000，单位 cm\\ :math:`^{-1}`\\ "
"）该选项指定要考虑的光谱范围的最大能量。"

msgid ""
"**``EMIN``\\ =\\ *value*** (= 0 Default, in cm\\ :math:`^{-1}`) This option "
"specifies the minimum energy of the spectral range to be considered."
msgstr ""
"**``EMIN``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** （默认 0，单位 cm\\ :math:`^{-1}`\\ "
"）该选项指定要考虑的光谱范围的最小能量。"

msgid ""
"**``TINC``\\ =\\ *value*** (= 100 Default, in K) Temperature increment to be"
" considered."
msgstr "**``TINC``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** （默认 100，单位 K）要考虑的温度增量。"

msgid ""
"**``TMAX``\\ =\\ *value*** (=0 (off) Default, in K) Maximum temperature to "
"be considered. Setting only ``TMIN`` will set ``TMAX`` to the same value."
msgstr ""
"**``TMAX``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** （默认 0（关闭），单位 K）要考虑的最高温度。仅设置 ``TMIN`` 会将 "
"``TMAX`` 设为相同值。"

msgid ""
"**``TMIN``\\ =\\ *value*** (=0 (off) Default, in K) Minimum temperature to "
"be considered. Setting only ``TMAX`` will set ``TMIN`` to the same value."
msgstr ""
"**``TMIN``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** （默认 0（关闭），单位 K）要考虑的最低温度。仅设置 ``TMAX`` 会将 "
"``TMIN`` 设为相同值。"

msgid ""
"**``TLIST``\\ =\\ *string*** (off Default, in K) List of temperatures to be "
"considered, e.g. ’200,250,300’. Combinable with other temperature-keywords. "
"to be considered."
msgstr ""
"**``TLIST``\\ =\\ *\\ string*** （默认关闭，单位 K）要考虑的温度列表，例如 "
"’200,250,300’。可与其他温度关键字组合使用。"

msgid ""
"**``FWHM``\\ =\\ *value*** Full width at half maximum (FWHM) to be used for "
"line-broadening (Gaussian, Lorentzian)."
msgstr "**``FWHM``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** 用于线宽（高斯、洛伦兹）的半高全宽（FWHM）。"

msgid ""
"**``FWHM_LIST``\\ =\\ *string*** (off Default) Define a list of values for "
"the FWHM to be used with Gaussian or Lorentzian line-broadening."
msgstr "**``FWHM_LIST``\\ =\\ *\\ string*** （默认关闭）定义用于高斯或洛伦兹线宽的 FWHM 值列表。"

msgid "**``GAMMA``\\ =\\ *value*** Half width (HWHM) to be used for Lorentzians."
msgstr "**``GAMMA``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** 用于洛伦兹线型的半宽（HWHM）。"

msgid ""
"**``GAMMA_LIST``\\ =\\ *string*** (off Default) Define a list of scaling "
"parametes ``GAMMA_SCALE`` for the half-width (HWHM) for Lorentzians used in "
"Voigt profile, e.g. ’1.0,3.0,10.0’."
msgstr ""
"**``GAMMA_LIST``\\ =\\ *\\ string*** （默认关闭）定义用于 Voigt 线型中洛伦兹半宽（HWHM）的缩放参数 "
"``GAMMA_SCALE`` 列表，例如 ’1.0,3.0,10.0’。"

msgid ""
"**``GAMMA_SCALE``\\ =\\ *value*** (=1.0 (off) Default) Scale the half-width "
"(HWHM) for Lorentzians used in Voigt profile as "
":math:`\\gamma`/``GAMMA_SCALE``."
msgstr ""
"**``GAMMA_SCALE``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** （默认 1.0（关闭））将 Voigt 线型中洛伦兹半宽（HWHM）缩放为 "
":math:`\\gamma`/``GAMMA_SCALE``\\ 。"

msgid ""
"**``SIGMA``\\ =\\ *value*** (= 1.0 Default, in cm\\ :math:`^{-1}`) Half "
"width to be used for Gaussians if ``PROFILE=’GAUSSIAN’``."
msgstr ""
"**``SIGMA``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** （默认 1.0，单位 cm\\ :math:`^{-1}`\\ ）当 "
"``PROFILE=’GAUSSIAN’`` 时用于高斯线型的半宽。"

msgid ""
"**``SIGMA_LIST``\\ =\\ *string*** (off Default) Define a list of scaling "
"parametes ``SIGMA_SCALE`` for the half-width for Gaussians used in Voigt "
"profile, e.g. ’1.0,3.0,10.0’."
msgstr ""
"**``SIGMA_LIST``\\ =\\ *\\ string*** （默认关闭）定义用于 Voigt 线型中高斯半宽的缩放参数 "
"``SIGMA_SCALE`` 列表，例如 ’1.0,3.0,10.0’。"

msgid ""
"**``SIGMA_SCALE``\\ =\\ *value*** (=1.0 (off) Default) Scale the half-width "
"for Gaussians used in Voigt profile as :math:`\\sigma`/``SIGMA_SCALE``."
msgstr ""
"**``SIGMA_SCALE``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** （默认 1.0（关闭））将 Voigt 线型中高斯半宽缩放为 "
":math:`\\sigma`/``SIGMA_SCALE``\\ 。"

msgid "**``PUNIT``\\ =\\ *string*** (=’atm’ Default) Pressure unit."
msgstr "**``PUNIT``\\ =\\ *\\ string*** （默认 ’atm’）压力单位。"

msgid ""
"**``PINC``\\ =\\ *value*** (= 0.1 atm Default, in ``PUNIT``) Pressure "
"increment to be considered."
msgstr "**``PINC``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** （默认 0.1 atm，单位 ``PUNIT``\\ ）要考虑的压力增量。"

msgid ""
"**``PMAX``\\ =\\ *value*** (= 1.0 atm Default, in ``PUNIT``) Maximum "
"pressure to be considered."
msgstr "**``PMAX``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** （默认 1.0 atm，单位 ``PUNIT``\\ ）要考虑的最高压力。"

msgid ""
"**``PMIN``\\ =\\ *value*** (= 1.0 atm Default, in ``PUNIT``) Minimum "
"pressure to be considered."
msgstr "**``PMIN``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** （默认 1.0 atm，单位 ``PUNIT``\\ ）要考虑的最低压力。"

msgid ""
"**``PLIST``\\ =\\ *string*** (off Default) List of pressures to be "
"considered, e.g. ’1.0,1.1,1.2’. Combinable with other pressure-keywords."
msgstr ""
"**``PLIST``\\ =\\ *\\ string*** （默认关闭）要考虑的压强列表，例如 "
"'1.0,1.1,1.2'。可与其他压强关键字组合使用。"

msgid ""
"**``PRINT``\\ =\\ *n*** (=0 (off) Default) ``PRINT=2`` enables additional "
"printout."
msgstr "**``PRINT``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** （=0（关闭）为默认值）\\ ``PRINT=2`` 启用额外打印输出。"

msgid ""
"**``RAMAN_POLANG``\\ =\\ *value*** (=90 Default) Raman polarisation angle "
"defining the prefactors mixing the isotropic and anisotropic Raman "
"transition moments for the calculation of Raman intensities."
msgstr ""
"**``RAMAN_POLANG``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** （=90 为默认值）Raman 偏振角，用于确定在计算 Raman "
"强度时混合各向同性和各向异性 Raman 跃迁矩的前置因子。"

msgid ""
"**``RAMAN_FAC(n)``\\ =\\ *value*** Set the prefactors for the isotropic and "
"anisotropic Raman transition moments for the calculation of Raman "
"intensities manually. :math:`n=0` will set the value for :math:`R_0`, "
":math:`n=2` the one for :math:`R_2`."
msgstr ""
"**``RAMAN_FAC(n)``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** 手动设置用于计算 Raman 强度的各向同性和各向异性 Raman "
"跃迁矩的前置因子。\\ :math:`n=0` 将设置 :math:`R_0` 的值，\\ :math:`n=2` 将设置 :math:`R_2` "
"的值。"

msgid ""
"**``RAMAN_LFREQ``\\ =\\ *value*** (=680 Default, in nm) Raman exciting "
"radiation (laser) frequency."
msgstr "**``RAMAN_LFREQ``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** （=680 为默认值，单位为 nm）Raman 激发辐射（激光）频率。"

msgid ""
"The following example generates a rovibrational IR spectrum for the spectral"
" range between 900 and 1100 cm\\ :math:`^{-1}` for the given temperature of "
"300 K from the line list provided in the file ``H2CS_IR_VCI_J3.dat`` and "
"dumps the output to ``H2CS_IR_VCI_J3_graph.dat``."
msgstr ""
"以下示例根据文件 ``H2CS_IR_VCI_J3.dat`` 中提供的谱线列表，为给定的 300 K 温度生成 900 至 1100 cm\\ "
":math:`^{-1}` 光谱范围内的振转红外光谱，并将输出转储到 ``H2CS_IR_VCI_J3_graph.dat``\\ 。"

msgid ""
"This example generates a Gauss-broadened rovibrational Raman spectrum from 0"
" to 200 cm\\ :math:`^{-1}` for a set of FWHM of :math:`\\{0.5,1.0,2.0\\}` "
"cm\\ :math:`^{-1}` and temperatures of :math:`\\{5,50,150,295\\}` K from the"
" line list provided in the file ``H2CS_Raman_RVCI_J3.dat`` and dumps the "
"output to ``H2CS_Raman_RVCI_J3_Gauss.dat`` by re-calculating intensities "
"from the transition moments :math:`R_0` and :math:`R_2` and uses a "
"polarization angle of :math:`90^\\circ` and a laser frequency of :math:`514`"
" nm."
msgstr ""
"此示例根据文件 ``H2CS_Raman_RVCI_J3.dat`` 中提供的谱线列表，针对半高全宽为 "
":math:`\\{0.5,1.0,2.0\\}` cm\\ :math:`^{-1}` 的一组值以及温度为 "
":math:`\\{5,50,150,295\\}` K 的一组值，通过由跃迁矩 :math:`R_0` 和 :math:`R_2` 重新计算强度，生成"
" 0 至 200 cm\\ :math:`^{-1}` 的 Gauss 展宽振转 Raman 光谱，并将输出转储到 "
"``H2CS_Raman_RVCI_J3_Gauss.dat``\\ ，且使用 :math:`90^\\circ` 的偏振角和 :math:`514` "
"nm 的激光频率。"
